ndow can consume a substantial portion of the remaining VRAM. If the context exceeds the available VRAM, the system must offload to system RAM, which is orders of magnitude slower, causing severe latency spikes. Therefore, the prefill speed on an RTX 4090 is highly dependent on the context length. For short contexts (under 4k tokens), the prefill is nearly instantaneous, often",
